WEBVTT

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:32.416
Nothing really special,
but a good pair of hands."

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:33.776
The recorder said,

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:36.416
"Sounds like Mary
should go in the middle bucket."

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:39.176
And then someone said, "Arnold Smith."

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:42.456
Before the person
could present Arnold's case,

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:46.296
somebody said, "Disaster. Disaster.
This kid doesn't have a clue.

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:47.656
Can't do a model."

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:50.176
And before the case was presented,

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.496
the recorder said,

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:54.736
"Sounds like Arnold
should go in the bottom bucket."

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:58.176
It was at that moment
that I clutched my pearls --

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:01.496
(Laughter)